<title>GREECE: KREKA TRADES EX-DIVIDEND TUES AUG 5.</title>
<headline>KREKA TRADES EX-DIVIDEND TUES AUG 5.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said</p>
<p>shares of parallel market listing Kreka will trade</p>
<p>ex-dividend on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    COMPANY	  DIVIDEND/SHARE	ADJUSTED START PRICE</p>
<p>    Kreka		  50  drachmas	    1,015</p>
<p>Also on Tuesday, shares of Intertech will trade</p>
<p>ex-bonus. Its adjusted starting price will be 2,900 drachmas.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
